# Per-date test data: commit the tiny expected_metrics.json baselines for every
# date (the regression ledger), but NOT the bulk *.gz event dumps (~20MB/day) —
# except the 2026-07-03 reference fixture, which stays committed so the test
# always has one date to run fully. Fetch other dates' data with
# tests/fetch_day.py <date> to re-verify their baselines locally.
tests/data/*/*.gz
!tests/data/2026-07-03/*.gz
data/fleet-events-archive-*/
# Backtest data pulls & console/output dumps (regenerable via fetch.py); keep .py + ml_runs/*.json
backtest/fiftycent/*.csv
backtest/fiftycent/*.txt
backtest/fiftycent/*_report.json
measurements/.last_breakdown.json
